31:      main diagonal quadrants of the interior.
32:    - A marker in the northeast or southwest side supplies the other two quadrants.
33:    - Split the frame interior into row and column halves and fill each cell by
34:      the diagonal class of its half-position.
35:
36:    Key insight:
37:    - The marker colors are not copied from their exact rows or columns; their
38:      coarse position relative to the frame center selects one of the two diagonal
39:      quadrant masks.
